        {
          "text": "Lino aya makani oonse naakamana, ba-Israyeli boonse ibakajanwa muminzi ya-Inda bakainka kuyoomwaya zipaililo. Bakagonka zisamu akumwaya zikombelo zyakuzilundu azipaililo zyoonse mucisi coonse ca-Juda aca-Benjamini aca-Efraimu aca-Manase, mane lumwi bakazimana. Mpawo bana boonse ba-Israyeli bakapiluka, umwi aumwi kumaanda aakwe, kuminzi yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.1"
            ]
          }
        }
