        {
          "text": "Nkabela Hezekiya wakabamba inkamu zyabapaizi azyaba-Levi. Bakaabwa munkamu, umwi aumwi mbuli milimo yakwe; bapaizi aba-Levi bakabikwa kuti balete zipaizyo azituuzyo zyakutontozya, kumana milimo akulumba akutembaula mumilyango yamalabba aa-Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
