                  "text": "Mal 3:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Azariya mupaizi silutwe waluzubo lwa-Zadoki wakamuvwiila kuti, Kuzwa kuciindi eco bantu nibakatalika kuleta zipo kuŋanda ya-Jehova twakuta kulya mane twaleka, nkaambo Jehova wapa bantu bakwe coolwe, lino zintu ezi zinji nzenzizyo zisyeede,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.10"
            ]
