              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalo Jeili a-Azaziya a-­Nahati a-Asahaeli a-Jerimoti a-Jozabadi a-Elieli a-Ismakiya a-Mahati a-Benaya, boonse bakali basilutwe mumaanza aa-Kononiya a-Simei munyina, mbubakalailila mwami Hezekiya a-Azariya silutwe waganda ya-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
